// ============================================================================
// AIPL Universal HEBAR Behavior Tree & DSL Engine (`aipl_hebar_bot/core/behavior_tree.aipl`)
// ============================================================================
// Parses and evaluates declarative .hebar conditional/decisional strategy specs
// (selector, sequence, parallel, condition, cooldown_ms, action) with branch
// utility tracking for self-improving bot learning.
// ============================================================================

